# fixture: synthetic_restriction_parent_after.ttl
# Purpose: ex:Door without the restriction superclass. The only delta versus the
# _before file is a synthetic restriction edge, so Component 07 emits no
# hierarchy change for ex:Door.

@prefix ex: <http://example.org/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

ex:Handle a owl:Class .
ex:hasPart a owl:ObjectProperty .
ex:Door a owl:Class .
